      "body": "Analysts have lifted their price target on Varun Beverages from ₹536.50 to about ₹587.23, citing updated assumptions that pair slightly higher projected revenue growth with a broadly similar profit margin profile and future P/E multiple. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on Apr 27, 2026 to review Unaudited Financial Results on a Standalone and Consolidated basis for the quarter ended Mar 31, 2026 (company filing).",
