      "date": "2026-04-28T11:25:42.000Z",
      "title": "First quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "First quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.58 (up from ₹2.15 in 1Q 2025). Revenue: ₹65.7b (up 18% from 1Q 2025). Net income: ₹8.72b (up 20% from 1Q 2025). Profit margin: 13% (in line with 1Q 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 8.2%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 12%. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Beverage industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 22% per year.",
